<title>UK: Amersham sells Safeguard stake to AEA.</title>
<headline>Amersham sells Safeguard stake to AEA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>British-based health science group Amersham International Plc said on Monday that it had sold its 50 percent stake in Safeguard International Ltd to AEA Technology Plc for 570,000 stg.</p>
<p>AEA, a specialist science and engineering group, already holds 50 percent of Safeguard.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
